    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Blood for Blood: 10 Al'Aketh Windstone Charms drop from the Brawlers here (10 from 19 looted, 53%), so about 20 Brawlers. Our old route sent you to the Stormchasers in the north for them; that was wrong."
      }
